#: crates/pigoune-app/src/smart_collection_dialog.rs:92
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"Words joined by “and” must all be found, words joined by “or” are "
"alternatives: click between two words to switch. Up to {max} words are "
"searched in the name, tags, note, source, license and author, whatever the "
"case and accents."
msgstr ""
"Las palabras unidas por “y” deben encontrarse todas, las unidas por “o” son "
"alternativas: haga clic entre dos palabras para cambiar. Se buscan hasta "
"{max} palabras en el nombre, las etiquetas, la nota, la fuente, la licencia "
"y el autor, sin importar mayúsculas ni acentos."

